        "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kotoba-lang/string/issues/1",
        "number": 1,
        "state": "closed",
        "locked": true,
        "title": "Restore prior extension: the rename left this code loadable by nothing",
        "user": {
          "login": "com-junkawasaki",
          "id": 623495,
          "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjYyMzQ5NQ==",
          "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/623495?v=4",
          "gravatar_id": "",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/com-junkawasaki",
          "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/followers",
          "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/following{/other_user}",
          "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/gists{/gist_id}",
          "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
          "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/subscriptions",
          "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/orgs",
          "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/repos",
          "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/events{/privacy}",
          "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/com-junkawasaki/received_events",
          "type": "User",
          "user_view_type": "public",
          "site_admin": false
        },
        "body": "`Rename src to .kotoba` was a **pure rename** (0 insertions, 0 deletions) and left this library loadable by **nothing**.\n\n- **nbb cannot load `.kotoba`** \u2014 it resolves a namespace from `:paths` by *extension*, so the source became invisible with no error. A rename does not fail.\n- **amu will not admit it either.** Measured in *project* mode (`--source-path --jvm-free`), not the single-file form that would be an unfair test.\n\nAcross the 17 repos this sweep covered: **19 renamed files, 19 failing admission \u2014 100%.** Same pattern that left the superproject's datom query face dead (`Could not find namespace: datalog.core`), which nothing reported.\n\nThis is **not** an argument against Q9. It is what `q9-migration.edn` already requires: source migration is a whole-component **build** change, and a component the compiler cannot admit is `:blocked`, not renamed. The admission error is the concrete list of what must be fixed before the extension can move.\n\n`kotoba-lang/kotoba@b7713494` now refuses this class mechanically (`compiled-by-build-config`): a source file under a directory a project file declares cannot be converted, because a build consumes source by extension and never names the file.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Y4Zz8xiCrCHNhSPaEPWGbK",
